      {
        "id": "refPick",
        "type": "code",
        "name": "参考图取首张",
        "position": {
          "x": 600,
          "y": 560
        },
        "config": {
          "code": "const refs = inputs.refs || [];\nreturn { first: (Array.isArray(refs) && refs.length > 0) ? refs[0] : '' };",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "key": "refs",
              "value": "{{readRef.imagePaths}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "kbQuery",
        "type": "kb-query-multi",
        "name": "多知识库检索参考",
        "position": {
          "x": 600,
          "y": 420
        },
        "config": {
          "knowledgeBaseIds": "{{start.knowledgeBaseIds}}",
          "query": "{{start.topic}} {{start.keyPoints}}",
          "topKPerKb": 6,
          "maxResults": 24
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "kbText",
        "type": "code",
        "name": "KB 结果转文本",
        "position": {
          "x": 760,
          "y": 420
        },
        "config": {
          "code": "const rows = Array.isArray(inputs.rows) ? inputs.rows : [];\nif (rows.length === 0) return { text: '' };\nreturn { text: rows.map((r, i) => '【来源' + (i + 1) + '｜库:' + String(r.knowledgeBaseId || '') + '｜文档:' + String(r.documentName || '') + '】' + String(r.content || '').slice(0, 500)).join('\\n\\n') };",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "key": "rows",
              "value": "{{kbQuery.results}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scriptSrc",
        "type": "code",
        "name": "整理脚本文案来源",
        "position": {
          "x": 760,
          "y": 700
        },
        "config": {
          "code": "const mode = String(inputs.mode || 'topic');\nconst assetText = String(inputs.assetText || '');\nconst text = String(inputs.scriptText || '');\nif (mode === 'asset') return { text: assetText };\nif (mode === 'text') return { text };\nreturn { text: '' }; // topic：由大纲阶段按主题+KB 生成",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "key": "mode",
              "value": "{{start.scriptSource}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "scriptText",
              "value": "{{start.scriptText}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "assetText",
              "value": "{{readScript.textJoined}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "preset",
        "type": "video-preset",
        "name": "视频类型预设装配",
        "position": {
          "x": 600,
          "y": 700
        },
        "config": {
          "videoType": "{{start.videoType}}",
          "freeStyle": "{{start.videoStyle}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "outlineReview",
        "type": "human-review",
        "name": "大纲审核",
        "position": {
          "x": 1460,
          "y": 560
        },
        "config": {
          "payload": {
            "stage": "大纲审核：批准后进入分镜拆解",
            "md": "{{writerMd.result.md}}"
          },
          "editableFields": [
            {
              "key": "md",
              "label": "大纲全文",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ],
          "timeoutMs": null,
          "timeoutPolicy": "fail"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "baseList",
        "type": "code",
        "name": "底图清单文本",
        "position": {
          "x": 1740,
          "y": 760
        },
        "config": {
          "code": "const assets = Array.isArray(inputs.assets) ? inputs.assets : [];\nreturn { text: assets.map((a, i) => '[' + i + '] ' + (a.name || '') + (a.description ? '：' + a.description : '')).join('\\n') };",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "key": "assets",
              "value": "{{readBase.assets}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "shotsGen",
        "type": "llm-chat",
        "name": "分镜拆解（含底图匹配）",
        "position": {
          "x": 2020,
          "y": 560
        },
        "config": {
          "systemPrompt": "你是资深短视频分镜师兼画面导演。依据用户确认的大纲把视频拆为 1~20 个镜头，并为每镜设计**真实世界里拍得到的画面**。\n【视频类型/风格规范】\n{{preset.promptBlock}}\n【视觉策略（当前模式 {{strategy.result.mode}}）】\n{{strategy.result.policyText}}\n【镜头真实场景词典（抽象主题 → 可拍场景 + 素材库英文检索词）】\n{{preset.sceneText}}\n【素材池（asset 模式引用；imagery 模式可参考）】（名称/描述/索引）\n{{baseList.result.text}}\n【大纲全文（用户已审核）】\n{{outlineReview.md}}\n【画面硬性要求】\n1) 每镜画面必须是\"真实世界可拍摄的具体场景\"：点名主体实体 + 场所环境 + 光线氛围 + 景别 + 运镜；\n   禁止把抽象概念（指数/趋势/信心/生态/赋能/风险/格局）单独成画；禁止任何文字/图表/UI/水印/海报/贴片（所有文字一律走 caption 字幕层）。\n2) 先用上面的场景词典把该镜语义归到某个主题簇，再落成该簇的可拍场景；词典未覆盖时自选一个真实存在、能拍到的场景。\n3) searchQuery 是给真实素材库用的**英文检索词**（2~4 个单词，只写画面里真实存在的实物与场所，如 container port terminal / factory production line / stock exchange trading floor）。\n【镜头规则】caption 为该镜字幕短句（≤18 字，不是口播原文）；duration 整数秒 4~16；一镜一场景一事件，一句口播含多地点/多事件时必须拆镜。\n【模式化镜头输出】依据上方\"视觉策略\"里的模式：\n - imagery 模式：每镜另给 subject（画面主体实体）/ setting（场所环境）/ visual（可执行画面描述）/ imagery（意象对象）/ searchQuery（英文检索词）/ altQueries（1~2 个备选英文检索词）/ shotSize（景别）/ cameraMove（运镜）。\n - asset 模式：每镜必须给 assetIdx（引用素材池索引，取值 0..{{strategy.result.baseCount}}-1）与 visual（描述该镜展示素材的角度/景别/运镜/氛围，主体来自素材）。\n输出 JSON 结构：{\"narration\":\"全片口播（原样保留可用 | 分句）\",\"shots\":[{\"concept\":\"语义主题\",\"subject\":\"画面主体实体\",\"setting\":\"场所环境\",\"visual\":\"画面描述（含光线/景别/运镜）\",\"imagery\":\"意象对象(仅 imagery)\",\"searchQuery\":\"英文检索词\",\"altQueries\":[\"备选1\",\"备选2\"],\"shotSize\":\"景别\",\"cameraMove\":\"运镜\",\"caption\":\"字幕短句\",\"duration\":秒,\"assetIdx\":素材索引(仅 asset)}]}。镜头总数 1~20。",
          "prompt": "请基于大纲与视觉策略输出镜头 JSON（每镜必须落到真实可拍场景，并给出英文 searchQuery）。",
          "jsonMode": true,
          "providerConfigId": "{{start.model.providerConfigId}}",
          "modelId": "{{start.model.modelId}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "splitShots",
        "type": "code",
        "name": "拆分镜头（生成/底图）",
        "position": {
          "x": 2300,
          "y": 560
